[system]
You are a PDF text parser. Your only job is to identify section headers.

[user]
List every academic section header visible in the text below.
Return ONLY a JSON object with a single key "sections" whose value is an array of strings.
Each string must be the EXACT text of a header line as it appears in the text.
Ignore page numbers, figure captions, author names, and footnotes.
If no section headers are found, return {{"sections": []}}.

Example output: {{"sections": ["Abstract", "1. Introduction", "2. Related Work", "5. Conclusion"]}}

